msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUsd012_01195:TEXT_GAIUSD012_01195_VORSAILE_000_004:1"
msgid "Though I imagine the birdmen have since made “adjustments” to their crystal, the beastman aetheryte found within Natalan remains the surest means of entry. May the Twelve strengthen your arm, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>."
msgstr "Птицелюди, должно быть, уже успели «усовершенствовать» свой кристалл, но эфирит зверолюдов в Наталане — всё ещё самый надёжный путь туда. Пусть Двенадцать укрепят вашу руку, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>."

#. ja: <ui-color 547>嵐神の力を高める試みは、想定通りに成功したが……<br>これほど容易に倒されるとは、いささか予想外だったな。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Die Göttin des Windes ist stärker geworden ... Genau, wie wir es vorhergesehen haben. Aber dass sie sich so schnell geschlagen geben würde, damit hatten wir nicht gerechnet.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Notre in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion a permis de renforcer Garuda comme nous l'avions prévu.<br>Mais qui aurait cru qu'elle serait vaincue aussi facilement<nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANSWORD
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUsd012_01195:TEXT_GAIUSD012_01195_ASCIANSWORD_000_020:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Our efforts to augment Garuda's powers were met with the predicted success. It is mildly unsatisfying, then, that the primal was thus summarily defeated.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Нам удалось усилить Гаруду, как и было задумано. И всё же досадно, что праймала так быстро одолели.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>あの光の使徒が相手では、生ぬるかったかナ。<br>しかもあの冒険者、依代まで目ざとく見つけたようだネ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Es ist <if $gn4>diese Kriegerin<else>dieser Krieger</if> des Lichts. <if $gn4>Ihre Kraft<else>Seine Kraft</if> wird immer noch unterschätzt. Und dann hat <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> zu allem Überfluss auch noch den Fokus entdeckt.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Elle n'a en effet pas été à la hauteur face à ce<if $gn4>tte</if> Protégé<if $gn4>e</if> de la Lumière.<br>Ce<if $gn4>tte</if> derni<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> a même trouvé im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment le substrat.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANSCEPTER
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUsd012_01195:TEXT_GAIUSD012_01195_ASCIANSCEPTER_000_021:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Against the Bringer of Light, it appears a heavier hand is required. And now that the focus has been discovered...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Против Вестника Света этого оказалось мало. А теперь ещё и фокус нашли...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>心配にはおよばない。<br>新たな召喚方法に勘付かれたところで<br>奴らに、召喚を食い止める術はない……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Sorge dich nicht, Bruder. Das Wissen über unseren neuen Beschwörungsritus nützt unseren Gegnern nichts, solange sie kein Mittel haben, ihn aufzuhalten.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Il n'y a rien à craindre à ce sujet.<br>Même s<if $gn4>i elle<else>'il</if> devine en quoi consiste ce nouveau rite d'invocation, rien ne pourra arrêter le retour des Primordiaux.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANSWORD
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUsd012_01195:TEXT_GAIUSD012_01195_ASCIANSWORD_000_022:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>It is of no consequence. Even should they understand the significance of its presence, they have no means to prevent the summonings.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Не о чем беспокоиться. Даже если они поймут, что это значит, остановить призывы им нечем.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>それに蛮族どもが、より強い蛮神を求めるしネ。<br>この連鎖が続くかぎり、ますます混沌は深まるはずだヨ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Die Wilden Stämme gieren nach immer stärkeren Primae. Wenn wir weiter und weiter ihre Wünsche bedienen, wird das Chaos unüberschaubar werden.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Oui, en effet.<br>Et tant que ces tribus barbares continueront de jouer notre jeu, le chaos ne fera qu'étendre son influence.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANSCEPTER
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUsd012_01195:TEXT_GAIUSD012_01195_ASCIANSCEPTER_000_023:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>And the beastmen continue to crave ever more powerful avatars every time their gods fall. With each link forged in this chain of ambition, the shackles of chaos are bound ever tighter.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>А зверолюды каждый раз, как их боги погибают, жаждут всё более могучих воплощений. Каждое новое звено этой цепи амбиций всё туже сковывает мир цепями хаоса.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>その判断を下されるのは、あの方々だ。<br>われらは事実を報告するまで……戻るぞ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Das zu beurteilen steht uns nicht zu.<br>Kehren wir zurück. Wir haben Bericht zu erstatten.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Ça, ce n'est pas à nous d'en juger.<br>Nous ne sommes là que pour rapporter ce qui s'est passé.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANSWORD
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUsd012_01195:TEXT_GAIUSD012_01195_ASCIANSWORD_000_024:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>It is not for us to entertain such speculation. We are bid only to convey what we have witnessed. Let us be gone from here.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Не нам рассуждать об этом. Нам велено лишь доложить о случившемся. Уходим.</ui-color>"

#. ja: おかえり、見事に討伐してくれたんだね！<br>さすがは<if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if>、感謝するよ！<br>……おや？　蛮神から気になるものを手に入れたって？
#. de: Willkommen zurück! Du hast fantastische Arbeit geleistet, <if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><string $gs1></if><else><string $gs1></if>. Das ist der Stoff, aus dem die Legenden sind.<br>Was sagst du? Du hast nach dem Kampf gegen den Primae etwas gefunden?
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Les Douze soient loués, vous êtes revenu<if $gn4>e</if> vivant<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>!<br>Je devine que vous avez donc réussi à nous débarrasser de Garuda.
#. speaker: VORSAILE
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><she… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
